$MDESC::Type = "DELTA FORCE";
$MDESC::Desc = "Hostage Rescue";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Hostage Rescue/Capture and Hold" @
         "\n<f1>Location: <f0> Damnitzhot Desert" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Dry and Hot" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Midday" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
"\n\n<f1>The story so far:" @
"\n<f0>  Seizing a chemical research facility located in a no-fly zone of the Damnitzhot Desert, a <f1>terrorist<f0> organization has forced a group of scientists to develop a bio-chemical agent capable of killing tens of thousands of people. The <f1>terrorists<f0> have issued a ransom message demanding the release of imprisoned compatriots and a large sum of money, or they will use the agent on a heavily populated city.  However, negotiations have failed and the <f1>terrorists<f0> are proceeding to gather the hostages for execution." @
"\n  It is now time for the <f1><vServer::teamName0><f0> to capture the facility, rescue the scientists, and eliminate the terrorists." @
"\n\n<f1>Conditions of Victory:<f0>" @
"\n<f1>  Terrorists:<f0>  Gather the hostages, control the facility." @
"\n<f1>  <vServer::teamName0>:<f0>  Eliminate Terrorists, capture the facility, return the scientists to the troop transport." @
"\n<f0>  First Team to reach <f1>1000<f0> points wins." @
"\n\n<f1>  ---- WARRNING ----" @
"\n<f0>There will be a noticeable framerate lag in some portions of this map." @
"\n<f0>This condition should not affect gameplay." @
"\n" @
"\n\n<f0>--- For use with the <f1>DELTA FORCE TRIBES<f0> modification. ---" @
"\n<f1>Map Notes:<f0> DF_FailedNegotiations_v0.5  10/13/00.  Redesigned by:<f1> Thrax-THC- ODFC" @
"\n<f1>http://planetstarsiege.com/deltaforce/            <f0>email: <f1>thrax@whoever.com" @

"\n\n<f0>Original terrain by:<f4> |MX3| DOX";